COMMENT ON COLUMN release_snapshot.snapshot_json IS '快照内容 JSON：全部段落源文及各语言译文、作者、审核人与版本号';
COMMENT ON COLUMN release_snapshot.created_at IS '发布时间，数据库默认时区';

